the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yrBlQxbX-6cQ7kNvwEclrP2&_nc_oc=AdqH5h0HvV_8LTNzoIpX47djq1CH3evQRZvjaI-bBBlUZX_DqyXDP5yVgKIJy1C0LXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4WJfV54YR2q0-5MhK-OrkKv4rFRRHnDtA2xeBvm2J6xA&oe=6A049783"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8NY99nDK7xYQ7kNvwF8gGMb&_nc_oc=AdpKCRCCl1rogMafez62CHaHTNfuzgCByjYCe6GvuthIoHRbIwZKPMU-yA7YwvQQz1s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6XqGVYaKrVJeMZmX1BAboIVTlNhqTJEX5Grdp95tbJjA&oe=6A048FD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IM8QuwEn4w4Q7kNvwGtVYyi&_nc_oc=Adpvf0aS0vt78d6-fsksAd6uz_qG8CuWyKS8jbNxKLwWSZBLsPSU_WLPyxBtLkA8dEY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4YrVQ1lW80rDe-WET63cp0FpmT5SppL5kdB7mNZaTlbA&oe=6A046ABC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080